('block-and-tackle', 'Block and tackle', 'Adventuring Gear', '1 gp', '5 lb', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A set of pulleys with a cable threaded through them and a hook to attach to objects, a block and tackle allows you to hoist up to four times the weight you can normally lift.'),
