('book', 'Book', 'Adventuring Gear', '25 gp', '5 lb', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A book might contain poetry, historical accounts, information pertaining to a particular field of lore, diagrams and notes on gnomish contraptions, or just about anything else that can be represented using text or pictures. A book of spells is a spellbook (described later in this section).'),
