('sealing-wax', 'Sealing wax', 'Adventuring Gear', '5 sp', '0 lb', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('shawm', 'Shawm', 'Tools', '2 gp', '1 lb', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Several of the most common types of musical instruments are shown on the table as examples. If you have proficiency with a given musical instrument, you can add your proficiency bonus to any ability checks you make to play music with the instrument. A bard can use a musical instrument as a spellcasting focus. Each type of musical instrument requires a separate proficiency.'),
